{"$schema":"model-preset/v1","agents":{"calico":{"model":"magpie:antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","variant":"medium"},"clowder":{"model":["magpie:antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered"]},"sphinx":{"model":"magpie:antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","variant":"high"},"tinker":{"model":"magpie:antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","temperature":0.2,"variant":"high"},"tuxeshadow":{"model":"magpie:antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","variant":"high"},"whisker":{"model":"magpie:antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered","variant":"low"}},"description":"Dev-testing preset: all roles use the user's own Magpie gateway model antigravity/gemini-3.8-flash-tiered (Antigravity, via Cloudflare tunnel https://magpie.raevtar.dev/v1). The gateway API key comes from env ${MAGPIE_API_KEY} only, never from a file in this repo. Meowstro follows the session model.","name":"magpie"}